# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Build output.
#
# Nothing below is source. The real build happens in the WSL ext4 copy
# (~/DEServer, created by ~/desync.sh), and these are the stale 2023 32-bit
# artifacts left in the source tree. lib/ alone is 3.8 GB of .a archives plus
# leftover `ar` temp files, and the three bin/ binaries are another 1.4 GB --
# well past GitHub's 100 MB per-file limit.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.o
*.a
lib/

# The stale 2023 server binaries. bin/ itself is kept: it holds start.sh,
# start.local.sh, stop.local.sh and daemon.sh, which are source.
bin/gameserver
bin/loginserver
bin/sharedserver

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Runtime logs.
#
# log/ stays in the repo on purpose -- it holds schema_migration_applied.sql,
# which is the record of every DB change made during the port and is the only
# way to reverse them. Only the rolling .log files are noise.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.log

# Build transcripts and stray compiler output: make.out, depall.out,
# info/log.out (3 MB) and src/server/database/a.out, which is a binary.
#
# NOTE: *.txt is deliberately NOT ignored. It looks like noise but holds real
# content -- src/ChangeLog.txt (269 KB of project history), monster.txt,
# chief_monster.txt, the Query.txt SQL references and CPacketList.txt.
*.out

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Editor and tooling leftovers
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.bak
*.orig
*.rej
*~
.vs/
.vscode/
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
